    skos:prefLabel 'Radial velocity (away from)'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The rate at which matter or an object moves away from a reference point along a line connecting the reference point to the moving object or particle of matter. In radar technology it is the component of the target\'s motion that is along the radar beam.'@en ;
